  "tempo": 1.12,
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "A bag of chips is mostly not chips,",
      "start": 0.088,
      "end": 1.839
    },
    {
      "text": "and the empty part is not air.",
      "start": 2.046,
      "end": 3.348
    },
    {
      "text": "Air is a fifth oxygen,",
      "start": 3.649,
      "end": 4.794
    },
    {
      "text": "and oxygen turns the oil in a chip rancid",
      "start": 5.019,
      "end": 7.216
    },
    {
      "text": "within days.",
      "start": 7.252,
      "end": 7.876
    },
    {
      "text": "So the bag gets flushed with nitrogen,",
      "start": 8.215,
      "end": 9.806
    },
    {
      "text": "which is inert and does nothing to food,",
      "start": 10.037,
      "end": 11.557
    },
    {
      "text": "and the oxygen inside drops to almost nothing.",
      "start": 11.813,
      "end": 13.975
    },
    {
      "text": "That is the freshness half.",
      "start": 14.239,
      "end": 15.311
    },
    {
      "text": "The other half is that chips are fragile and",
      "start": 15.559,
      "end": 17.186
    },
    {
      "text": "get stacked,",
      "start": 17.221,
      "end": 17.792
    },
    {
      "text": "dropped and driven across a country,",
      "start": 18.029,
      "end": 19.404
    },
    {
      "text": "so the gas is also a pillow.",
      "start": 19.493,
      "end": 20.815
    },
    {
      "text": "You are buying a cushion that doubles as a",
      "start": 21.075,
      "end": 22.575
    },
    {
      "text": "preservative.",
      "start": 22.629,
      "end": 23.165
    }
